  "description": "The Batch 12” Kids Bike is built for little adventurers ready to roll into their first big rides. Designed with a lightweight 6061 aluminum frame, it’s easy for kids to handle while providing the durability parents trust. The single-speed design and rear coaster brake make stopping simple, helping young riders build confidence as they learn. With aluminum wheels and street-style tires, this bike delivers a smooth ride whether cruising sidewalks or exploring the neighborhood.\nComfort matters too—this bike features a padded BMX-style seat and an adjustable handlebar for a personalized fit that grows with your child. Plus, with bold color options like Indigo Blue and Dusted Green, kids can ride in style. Whether it’s a first ride, a trip to the park, or a backyard adventure, the Batch 12” Kids Bike is ready for the journey.",
